# Component Documentation

When creating or significantly changing a component, update `docs/components/README.md`.

Document:

- component name and file path;
- responsibility;
- when to use it;
- important props or variants;
- Design System tokens or shared helpers it depends on;
- accessibility concerns, if any.

For complex landing sections, also update `docs/architecture.md` if the section gets a new folder structure or subcomponent pattern.

Keep examples short and tied to real files. Do not document placeholder APIs.
